<!--
    Flat wallet glyph, Google-style: bold multi-color artwork on a white
    background (see @color/ic_launcher_background). A two-tone blue bifold
    wallet (lighter body, darker front pocket with a straight seam), two cards
    peeking straight up from behind the top edge at staggered heights (yellow
    behind-left, red front-right), and a green clasp button with a white dot
    sitting on the pocket seam. Uses the four Google brand colors, axis-aligned
    geometry and consistent corner radii for a premium flat look; placeholder
    until final branding.

    The whole artwork is wrapped in one group that scales it down and nudges it
    up, so it keeps a comfortable margin from the maskable edge and reads as
    centred in the frame. Draw order: cards (behind), wallet body, pocket band,
    clasp button, clasp dot.
-->
